  <FCSettingEfficiencyDamping>战斗效能对战局的影响程度（0 = 仅影响生命值，1 = 完整影响）</FCSettingEfficiencyDamping>
	<!-- EN: Controls how much the military efficiency stat affects auto-resolve battle outcomes.

At 0, military efficiency affects only the effective level of both forces.

At 1, military efficiency fully affects each round of auto combat. Military forces of lower level but higher efficiency can often beat forces of a higher level, but lower efficiency.

Values in between dampen the effect of military efficiency on the auto combat. -->
  <FCSettingEfficiencyDampingTooltip>控制战斗效能属性对自动结算的战斗结果的影响。\n\n此值为 0 时，战斗效能仅影响交战双方的军力等级。\n\n此值为 1 时，战斗效能将影响自动交战的每个回合。低级别高效能的队伍在此数值下常能击败高级别低效能的敌人。\n\n其余的中间值将从1到0平滑战斗效能对作战结果的影响。\n\n\n  </FCSettingEfficiencyDampingTooltip>
